  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người được chọn có bệnh nền””&thinsp; và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người này có phản ứng phụ sau tiêm””.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>82</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là xác suất để một người bệnh có phản ứng sau tiêm với điều kiện có bệnh nền, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là xác suất để một người bệnh có phản ứng sau tiêm với điều kiện không có bệnh nền, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTheo công thức Bayes, ta được \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\